Release verified day-bucket copies within the bounded publication queue

Keep original recovery fragments until the full day manifest commits. Remove each encoded duplicate after successful remote byte readback and record its verified encoded size. This bounds staging by active publication workers. Windows day-bucket and artifact-commit regressions passed.


